                                        "entry_id": "2fadf75a-32c9-3969-8024-1c806f2a2f32",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The area atop a roof."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "formal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "589b566d-bdb7-4c99-9263-6540a8ab7c02",
                                                "sense_id": "acf2dabd-3d2d-38b6-9286-b5a148ded82b",
                                                "text": "In love, however, women are brave. How many clamber over rooftops of houses and palaces, and are still doing it, when their lovers await them!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c4fef8b-71c2-4321-9022-59e54825ece5",
                                                "sense_id": "acf2dabd-3d2d-38b6-9286-b5a148ded82b",
                                                "text": "Why do you think the rooftop of their apartment building is called \"tar beach\"? (Answers may vary.)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "17a083c2-7ed8-4dc8-a737-2c127b444269",
                                                "sense_id": "acf2dabd-3d2d-38b6-9286-b5a148ded82b",
                                                "text": "Riding the District west of Hammersmith, you immediately know something exciting is coming up, because at Ravenscourt Park you are level with the rooftops."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c820d30c-bfe5-3a7e-9b90-caa49d3fc9c8",
                                        "entry_id": "2fadf75a-32c9-3969-8024-1c806f2a2f32",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The top layer of a roof; the material covering or composing a roof."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a4eb05a4-da6c-4402-b9c8-f69290de358c",
                                                "sense_id": "c820d30c-bfe5-3a7e-9b90-caa49d3fc9c8",
                                                "text": "The house itself was a mound of red baked bricks and a tin rooftop."
                                            }
